      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Inflation and the quantum account of primordial structure transformed cosmology and provide the framework behind a large body of precise observations.",
        "attribution": "Guth initiated inflation, Linde developed its durable forms, and Mukhanov supplied the central quantitative theory of primordial perturbations.",
        "maturity": "Its principal broad predictions have received extensive indirect support from CMB and structure measurements over decades.",
        "uncertainties": [
