        "Charles L. Bennett",
        "David N. Spergel",
        "Lyman A. Page Jr."
      ],
      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "WMAP made precision cosmology a mature empirical science by extracting a remarkably detailed account of the early universe.",
        "attribution": "Bennett and Page led the experimental mission, while Spergel was central to converting its measurements into cosmological inference.",
        "maturity": "The measurements and their broad cosmological conclusions have been independently tested and extended for many years.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "Credit for a large satellite collaboration is inevitably difficult to compress into three names."
        ]
      }
    },
