        "attribution": "Halzen has a strong claim through his decisive intellectual and institutional leadership in making IceCube possible.",
        "maturity": "The astrophysical neutrino flux is established and the observatory has developed into a productive astronomical instrument.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The breakthrough was fundamentally collaborative, so individual attribution requires careful scrutiny."
        ]
      }
    },
