        "nobel_worthiness": "BAO turned a relic of early-universe physics into a precise standard ruler and gave dark-energy studies a powerful geometric foundation.",
        "attribution": "Eisenstein, Cole, and Percival made landmark observational and analytical contributions to establishing the method.",
        "maturity": "Multiple surveys have reproduced and greatly extended the BAO result across redshift.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The discovery emerged from broad survey collaborations, complicating a three-person allocation."
        ]
      }
    },
