        "attribution": "These scientists have central leadership roles in the pulsar-timing enterprise, though the achievement is intensely collaborative.",
        "maturity": "Independent pulsar-timing arrays report consistent evidence, but the result is still young.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The detailed astrophysical origin and spectral interpretation remain under active investigation.",
          "A longer observational baseline is desirable before a prize decision."
        ]
      }
    },
