        "nobel_worthiness": "These effects exposed deep physical content in phase and geometry, with consequences from quantum foundations to modern condensed matter.",
        "attribution": "Aharonov is inseparable from the Aharonov-Bohm effect and Berry from the geometric phase that bears his name.",
        "maturity": "Both ideas have been repeatedly tested and have become standard parts of quantum physics.",
